{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23644","headline":"醉赠刘二十八使君 · 白居易","name":"醉赠刘二十八使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲我引桮添酒饮，与君把箸击盘歌。\n诗称国手徒爲尔，命压人头不奈何。\n举眼风光长寂寞，满朝官职独蹉跎。\n亦知合被才名折，二十三年折太多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}